                    "value": "Countries that adopted the euro are compared with countries that did not change currency at the same time: the euro area (EA19) and non-euro neighbours (Hungary, Poland, Czechia, Romania). Every adopter is aligned on its own adoption month (month 0), and prices are set to 100 in the month before.",
