                  {
                    "value": "Croatia vs control",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " - prices in one country against one comparison group, and the gap between them (excess). The dark orange line is the estimated euro effect: the gap that the pre-euro trend does not explain. A step up after month 0 is a euro effect. The breakdown on the right shows how it is worked out for the months after adoption in the selected window.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
